    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18003" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fĕrŭlācĕus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj.
		ferula. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Made of fennel-giant</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rudens,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					34, 18, 50, § 170</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Resembling fennel-giant</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">genus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					19, 9, 56, § 173</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caulis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					27, 10, 62, § 89</span></i>
			.</div>
